{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07490","headline":"江楼送太康郭主簿赴岭南 · 刘长卿","name":"江楼送太康郭主簿赴岭南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"对酒怜君安可论，当官爱士如平原。\n料钱用尽却爲谤，食客空多谁报恩。\n万里孤舟向南越，苍梧云中暮帆灭。\n树色应无江北秋，天涯尚见淮阳月。\n驿路南随桂水流，猨声不绝到炎州。\n青山落日那堪望，谁见思君江上楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07490.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07490","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}